[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":124},"routes/item",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8,"_9":10},"item",{"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":20,"_21":22,"_23":24,"_25":26,"_27":28,"_29":28,"_30":31,"_32":33,"_34":35,"_36":37,"_38":39,"_40":-5,"_41":-5,"_42":43,"_44":-5,"_45":46,"_47":48,"_49":50,"_51":52,"_53":37,"_54":37,"_55":-5,"_56":37,"_57":58},"expiresAt",1795480833000,"id","b7fagpjz2rm06udejoz3syyf2","title","Cisco 排查 nginx 远程代码执行漏洞对产品的影响","originalTitle","Vulnerabilities in nginx Affecting Cisco Products: November 2026","summary","Cisco PSIRT 通报 nginx 1.9.5 至 1.31.8 存在多个可能导致远程代码执行的严重漏洞，已在 1.31.9 和 1.30.7 修复，涉及 CVE-2026-113425、CVE-2026-121810、CVE-2026-123007、CVE-2026-123633、CVE-2026-123634。","reason","通告列明 nginx 多个漏洞的受影响版本、Cisco 产品排查状态和首批修复版本，便于相关用户核对暴露范围与升级路径。","source",{"_62":123},"links",{"_113":122},"publishedAt","2026-11-20T08:00:00.000Z","discoveredAt","2026-11-20T20:33:30.286Z","timelineAt","category","vuln","tags",[117,118,119,120,121],"score",70,"selected",true,"channel","news","story","x","readingMode","full","author","body",{"_58":112,"_113":-5,"_114":115,"_116":37},"outline",[66,67,68,69,70,71,72,73,74,75,76,77,78,79],"relatedStories",[],"topics",[59,60],"indexable","markdownAvailable","group","hasTranslation","bodyLanguage","zh",{"_61":64,"_62":65},{"_61":31,"_62":63},"slug","name","漏洞披露","cisco","Cisco / 思科",{"_11":110,"_81":111,"_83":84},{"_11":108,"_81":109,"_83":84},{"_11":106,"_81":107,"_83":84},{"_11":104,"_81":105,"_83":84},{"_11":102,"_81":103,"_83":84},{"_11":100,"_81":101,"_83":84},{"_11":98,"_81":99,"_83":84},{"_11":96,"_81":97,"_83":84},{"_11":94,"_81":95,"_83":84},{"_11":92,"_81":93,"_83":84},{"_11":90,"_81":91,"_83":84},{"_11":88,"_81":89,"_83":87},{"_11":85,"_81":86,"_83":87},{"_11":80,"_81":82,"_83":84},"sec-14","text","反馈","level",2,"sec-13","法律免责声明详情",3,"sec-12","软件下载与技术支持","sec-11","法律免责声明","sec-10","修订历史","sec-9","URL","sec-8","与本公告相关","sec-7","Cisco 安全漏洞策略","sec-6","来源","sec-5","利用情况与公开公告","sec-4","固定软件","sec-3","临时解决方案","sec-2","受影响的产品","sec-1","摘要","<h2 id=\"sec-1\">\n<p>\n                        摘要\n                        \n                      </p>\n</h2><ul>\n<li>\n<p>2026 年 11 月 18 日，nginx 宣布已提供针对 nginx 中多个严重漏洞的修复，这些漏洞可能导致远程代码执行。这些漏洞影响 nginx 1.9.5 至 1.31.8 版本，并已在 1.31.9（mainline）和 1.30.7（stable）版本中修复。</p>\n<p>这些漏洞由以下 CVE 标识：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CVE-2026-113425：NGINX ngx_mail_proxy_module 漏洞</li>\n<li>CVE-2026-121810：NGINX ngx_http_v3_module 漏洞</li>\n<li>CVE-2026-123007：NGINX ngx_http_v2_module 漏洞</li>\n<li>CVE-2026-123633：NGINX ngx_http_v2_module 漏洞</li>\n<li>CVE-2026-123634：NGINX resolver 漏洞</li>\n</ul>\n<p>有关更多信息，请参阅<a href=\"https://nginx.org/en/security_advisories.html\">nginx 安全公告</a>。</p>\n<p>随着更多信息的发布，本公告将进行更新。</p>\n<p>本公告可通过以下链接获取：<br><a href=\"https://sec.cloudapps.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-nginx-nov-2026-e8jska2s\">https://sec.cloudapps.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-nginx-nov-2026-e8jska2s</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul><h2 id=\"sec-2\">\n<p>\n                          受影响的产品\n                          \n                        </p>\n</h2><ul>\n<li>\n<p>Cisco 正在调查其产品线，以确定哪些产品可能受到这些漏洞的影响。随着调查推进，Cisco 将更新本公告，补充受影响产品的信息。</p>\n<p>如果 Cisco 确定某款产品受到这些漏洞影响，首批修复版本将列于下表。如果表中注明了未来的发布日期，该日期是基于截至本公告顶部“最后更新”日期时 Cisco 所知全部信息作出的估算。可用日期可能因多种因素而发生变化，包括测试结果是否令人满意，以及其他优先功能和修复的交付情况。有关更多信息，请参阅关联的 Cisco Bug ID。</p>\n<p>下表列出了 Cisco 优先产品，以及针对本公告所述漏洞影响的调查状态。随着更多信息的发布，此表将进行更新。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Cisco 产品</th>\n<th>状态或 Bug ID</th>\n<th>修复版本信息</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Catalyst Center</td>\n<td>不受影响</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Catalyst SD-WAN Controller</td>\n<td>不受影响</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Catalyst SD-WAN Manager</td>\n<td>不受影响</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Catalyst SD-WAN Validator</td>\n<td>正在调查</td>\n<td> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Identity Services Engine (ISE)</td>\n<td>仅 Release 3.5 受到影响<br><a href=\"https://bst.cloudapps.cisco.com/bugsearch/bug/CSCwx92289\">CSCwx92289</a></td>\n<td>3.5 Patch 5（2026 年 12 月）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IOS XE Software</td>\n<td>正在调查</td>\n<td> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IOS XR Software</td>\n<td>正在调查</td>\n<td> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Nexus Dashboard</td>\n<td>不受影响</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NX-OS Software</td>\n<td>受到影响</td>\n<td> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Secure Firewall Adaptive Security Appliance (ASA) Software</td>\n<td>不受影响</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Secure Firewall Management Center (FMC) Software</td>\n<td>不受影响</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Secure Firewall Threat Defense (FTD) Software</td>\n<td>不受影响</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UCS Central Software</td>\n<td>不受影响</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UCS Director</td>\n<td>正在调查</td>\n<td> </td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>重要提示：</strong>本公告仅列出已知包含受影响软件组件的 Cisco 产品和服务。</p>\n\n<p>下表列出了受本公告所述漏洞影响的 Cisco 产品。随着更多信息的发布，此表将进行更新。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Cisco 产品</th>\n<th>状态或 Bug ID</th>\n<th>修复版本信息</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\">Cable Devices</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Smart PHY</td>\n<td>受到影响</td>\n<td>27.1.0（2027 年 3 月）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\">Unified Computing</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Intersight Virtual Appliance</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://bst.cloudapps.cisco.com/bugsearch/bug/CSCwx92113\">CSCwx92113</a></td>\n<td>1.1.9-0（2026 年 12 月）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\">Cisco Cloud Hosted Services</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Vulnerability Management（原 Kenna.VM）</td>\n<td>受到影响</td>\n<td>1.30.7（2026 年 11 月）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<br><p>只有本安全公告<a href=\"https://sec.cloudapps.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-nginx-nov-2026-e8jska2s?vs_f=Cisco%20Security%20Advisory%26vs_cat=Security%20Intelligence%26vs_type=RSS%26vs_p=Vulnerabilities%20in%20nginx%20Affecting%20Cisco%20Products:%20November%202026%26vs_k=1#affectfield\">受影响产品</a>部分列出的产品才已知受到这些漏洞的影响。</p>\n\n\n\n</li>\n</ul><h2 id=\"sec-3\">\n\n<p>\n                          临时解决方案\n                          \n                        </p>\n</h2><ul>\n<li>\n<p>任何临时解决方案都将在特定产品的 Cisco bugs 中记录，这些 bugs 在本安全公告的<a href=\"https://sec.cloudapps.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-nginx-nov-2026-e8jska2s?vs_f=Cisco%20Security%20Advisory%26vs_cat=Security%20Intelligence%26vs_type=RSS%26vs_p=Vulnerabilities%20in%20nginx%20Affecting%20Cisco%20Products:%20November%202026%26vs_k=1#affectfield\">受影响产品</a>部分标识。</p>\n</li>\n</ul><h2 id=\"sec-4\">\n<p>\n                          固定软件\n                          \n                        </p>\n</h2><ul>\n<li>\n<p>有关<a href=\"https://sec.cloudapps.cisco.com/security/center/resources/security_vulnerability_policy.html#fixes\">固定软件发行版本</a>的信息，请参阅本安全公告<a href=\"https://sec.cloudapps.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-nginx-nov-2026-e8jska2s?vs_f=Cisco%20Security%20Advisory%26vs_cat=Security%20Intelligence%26vs_type=RSS%26vs_p=Vulnerabilities%20in%20nginx%20Affecting%20Cisco%20Products:%20November%202026%26vs_k=1#affectfield\">受影响产品</a>部分标识的 Cisco bugs。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sec.cloudapps.cisco.com/security/center/resources/security_vulnerability_policy.html#fixes\">考虑软件升级</a>时，建议客户定期查阅 Cisco 产品的安全公告；这些公告可从<a href=\"https://www.cisco.com/go/psirt\">Cisco 安全公告</a>页面获取，以确定暴露情况并获得完整的升级解决方案。</p>\n<p>Cisco 产品安全事件响应团队（PSIRT）仅验证本安全公告中记录的受影响发行版本和修复发行版本信息。</p>\n</li>\n</ul><h2 id=\"sec-5\">\n<p>\n                          利用情况与公开公告\n                          \n                        </p>\n</h2><ul>\n<li>\n<p>Cisco PSIRT 已知悉存在针对本安全公告所述漏洞的概念验证利用代码。</p>\n<p>Cisco PSIRT 未发现本安全公告所述漏洞被恶意利用的情况。</p>\n\n</li>\n</ul><h2 id=\"sec-6\">\n<p>\n                          来源\n                          \n                        </p>\n</h2><ul>\n<li>\n<p>这些漏洞由 nginx 披露。</p>\n</li>\n</ul><h2 id=\"sec-7\">\n<p>\n        Cisco 安全漏洞策略\n        \n      </p>\n</h2><ul>\n<li>\n\n</li>\n</ul><ul>\n<li>\n\n</li>\n</ul><h2 id=\"sec-8\">\n<p>\n          \n          与本公告相关\n        </p>\n</h2><h2 id=\"sec-9\">\n<p>\n                        URL\n                        \n                      </p>\n</h2><ul>\n<li>\n\n</li>\n</ul><h2 id=\"sec-10\">\n<p>\n                        修订历史\n                        \n                      </p>\n</h2><ul>\n<li>\n<table>\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<th>版本</th>\n\t\t\t<th>说明</th>\n\t\t\t<th>部分</th>\n\t\t\t<th>状态</th>\n\t\t\t<th>日期</th>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>1.0</td>\n\t\t\t<td>首次公开发布。</td>\n\t\t\t<td>-</td>\n\t\t\t<td>临时</td>\n\t\t\t<td>2026-NOV-20</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><a>显示更少</a>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul><hr><h2 id=\"sec-11\">\n<p>\n                          法律免责声明\n                        </p>\n</h2><ul>\n<li>\n<h3 id=\"sec-12\">软件下载与技术支持</h3><p>Cisco.com 上的<a href=\"https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/support/index.html\">Cisco 支持与下载</a>页面提供有关许可和下载的信息。对于使用 My Devices 工具的客户，该页面还可显示客户设备的support覆盖范围。请注意，客户只能下载直接向 Cisco 或通过 Cisco 授权经销商或合作伙伴采购且许可证仍然有效的软件。</p><p>直接向 Cisco 购买但未持有 Cisco 服务合同的客户，以及通过第三方供应商购买但未能通过其销售点获得修复软件的客户，应联系<a href=\"https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/support/web/tsd-cisco-worldwide-contacts.html\">Cisco 技术援助中心（TAC）</a>获取升级。客户应备好产品序列号，并准备提供本公告的 URL，作为免费升级权益的证明。</p><p><a href=\"https://sec.cloudapps.cisco.com/security/center/resources/security_vulnerability_policy.html#fixes\">考虑软件升级</a>时，建议客户定期查阅相关 Cisco 产品的<a href=\"https://www.cisco.com/go/psirt\">安全公告</a>，以确定暴露情况并获得完整的升级解决方案。在所有情况下，客户应确保待升级设备具有足够的内存，并确认当前的硬件和软件配置在新的发行版本发布后仍将得到适当支持。如果信息不明确，建议客户联系<a href=\"https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/support/web/tsd-cisco-worldwide-contacts.html\">Cisco 技术援助中心（TAC）</a>或其签约维护提供商。</p><h3 id=\"sec-13\">法律免责声明详情</h3><p>CISCO 不作出任何明示或暗示的保证或承诺，包括但不限于适销性或适用于特定用途的保证。在不限制前述一般性声明的前提下，CISCO 不保证本信息的准确性或完整性。本文档按“现状”提供。您使用本文档或从本文档链接的材料，风险自负。CISCO 保留随时更改或更新本文档的权利。</p><p>本安全公告所含信息的副本或摘要可能缺少重要信息或包含事实错误。建议客户访问 <a href=\"https://www.cisco.com/go/psirt\">Cisco 安全公告</a>页面，以获取本安全公告的最新版本。Cisco 产品安全事件响应团队（PSIRT）仅评估本公告中记录的受影响版本和修复版本信息。有关更多信息，请参阅<a href=\"https://sec.cloudapps.cisco.com/security/center/resources/security_vulnerability_policy.html#fixes\">Cisco 安全漏洞政策</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul><h2 id=\"sec-14\">\n<p>\n                          反馈\n                        </p>\n</h2><ul>\n<li>\n\n</li>\n</ul>","original","zhKind","translation","complete","漏洞","补丁","复现","Cisco","网络设备","https://sec.cloudapps.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-nginx-nov-2026-e8jska2s?vs_f=Cisco%20Security%20Advisory%26vs_cat=Security%20Intelligence%26vs_type=RSS%26vs_p=Vulnerabilities%20in%20nginx%20Affecting%20Cisco%20Products:%20November%202026%26vs_k=1","Cisco PSIRT",{"_125":126,"_127":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
